    <section class="section">
        <h2>Research Interests</h2>
        <p>My research work entails social stratification and demography, using an interdisciplinary approach to investigate potential inequalities resulting from the interaction of gender and sexual orientation in various aspects of life.</p>
        <p>Recently, my research has focused on the life trajectories of non-heterosexual individuals and how sexual orientation influences aspects such as partnership transitions and educational careers.</p>
        <p>My PhD project explores the extent to which sexual orientation is related to and affects educational attainment, and how it contributes to shape adult opportunities for LGB(TQIA*) pupils.</p>
